{title: Toma mi vida, Cristo Señor}
{key: Eb}

{comment: Verso 1}
[Eb]Toma mi vida, [Ab]Cristo [Eb]Señor,
[Ab]Gran alfarero, [Eb]mi [Bb7]Creador.
[Eb]Barro en tus [Ab]manos es [Cm]lo que soy,
[Eb]Dócil y humilde, [Bb7]tóma[Eb]me hoy.

{comment: Verso 2}
[Eb]Toma mi vida, [Ab]Cristo [Eb]Señor,
[Ab]Hazme un [Eb]vaso para [Bb7]honor,
[Eb]Bello y [Ab]digno, Cristo, [Cm]de ti,
[Eb]Con un reflejo [Bb7]tuyo [Eb]en mí.

{comment: Verso 3}
[Eb]Toma mi vida, [Ab]Cristo [Eb]Señor,
[Ab]Quita el [Eb]pecado [Bb7]engañador.
[Eb]Mira y [Ab]prueba mi [Cm]corazón;
[Eb]Lléname de tu [Bb7]santa [Eb]unción.

{comment: Verso 4}
[Eb]Toma mi vida, [Ab]Cristo [Eb]Señor,
[Ab]Tuya es la [Eb]gloria, tuyo [Bb7]el honor.
[Eb]Dueño [Ab]absoluto Tú [Cm]quieres ser;
